# Vendored ENSIP-15 conformance suite (37,484 cases, ~10MB) — only needed to
# run test/ens/normalize_test.dart locally/in CI, never imported by
# published code. Excluding it from the published archive keeps `pub get`
# lean for consumers; see test/fixtures/ensip15/ATTRIBUTION.md for
# provenance if you need to fetch it yourself.
test/fixtures/ensip15/ens-normalize-tests.json

# Anvil-backed integration tests: they need Foundry and, for the Safe tests, a
# network fork of Base, so nobody can run them from a downloaded package.
test/integration/
